36  private static String hash8(String s) {  // first 8 UPPER-hex of SHA-256(telephone+lastName)
```
Note: the mapper feeds `locality` from `CustomerCodes.regionOf(customerCode)`, which re-extracts the already-stored region prefix; the underlying region truth is `Localities.regionOf(city, postcode)`.

### householdId
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/Households.java` (package-private class).
```java
20  private static String normalize(String value) {
