```
First 12 hex chars of SHA-256 over `normalizedLastName + "|" + postcode`. Set onto the owner in the controller at `OwnerRestControllerV1.java:98` and `:126`. Stored as a `@Transient` field on `Owner` (`Owner.java:117-126`).

### identityKey
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/IdentityKeys.java`.
```java
