Discrepancy worth flagging: the OpenAPI spec (below, lines 2277-2285) documents `identityKey` as the plaintext `'normalizedTelephone|email|householdId'` with example `'+61412345678||'`, but the actual implementation returns a hashed digest built from a Soundex of the last name, not the householdId. The doc and code disagree.

### memberId
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/MemberIds.java`.
