## 2. Owner response DTO / shape

The DTO is generated from OpenAPI, so the shape lives in the spec and the MapStruct mapper.

### Mapper — where every identity field is populated
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` lines 28-37 (verbatim):
